1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,940
Mummy, padhai khatam ho gayi, ab ghar pe bore ho rahi hoon.

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:08,572
Pinky, teri mehendi poori gali mein famous hai! Mehendi artist ban ja!

3
00:00:08,872 --> 00:00:11,148
Par Mummy, isse kamai hoti hai kya?

4
00:00:11,448 --> 00:00:16,784
Bas 5 hazaar ki mehendi, cone aur ek achha phone. Photo kheench ke Instagram pe daal.

5
00:00:17,084 --> 00:00:21,519
Shaadi, Teej aur Karwa Chauth ka season pakad. Tab to din bhar booking rahegi.

6
00:00:22,069 --> 00:00:26,540
Pinky didi, agle hafte meri shaadi hai! Full haath, pair tak mehendi chahiye!

7
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:31,190
Bridal package, ₹5,100. Doolhe ka naam bhi chhupa doongi!

8
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:35,644
Season mein hafte ki 4-5 dulhan, mahine ke 30 hazaar se upar.

9
00:00:35,944 --> 00:00:41,334
Phir do ladkiyan sikha kar team bana. Badi shaadiyon mein poora parivaar mehendi lagwata hai.

10
00:00:41,634 --> 00:00:44,754
Pinky Mehendi Arts, booking full! Life set!
